[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429604\">7040L40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429644\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429642\">7050A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429597\">7040H50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429589\">7040G30</a>\n                                           (left\nside only)</p><p>1. Release the cap.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts.</p><p>3. Move the trim (3a) slightly releasing the inner retainers (3b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045244.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the parking sensor buzzer.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Parking sensor buzzer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428756\">P44</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Save the trim.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045245.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the trim is not\ndamaged and that the retainers are intact.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Position the trim fitting the inner retainers.</p><p>Tighten the bolts.</p><p>Fit the plug.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429589\">7040G30</a>\n                                           (left\nside only)</p><p><a href=\"#/2429597\">7040H50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429642\">7050A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429644\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429604\">7040L40</a></p>"]]